    "Small profiled diagnostic (32 episodes per arm/matrix); never replaces retained unprofiled full-episode performance primary.",
    "Runtime table includes named CUDA runtime and direct driver APIs. Per-episode API attribution uses exact same-thread NVTX containment; counts and elapsed union are profiler observations.",
