  ],
  "conclusion": "Same kernel geometry and same per-mode API counts. Extra FP8-optin GPU cost is in attention (+about5.3us), while its merge is about1.34us faster. Public replay removes native resource-query APIs symmetrically but preserves the attention gap. Profiling does not establish a new unprofiled performance number or isolate the exact attention source factor."
